; cluster for all energy quantities: the capacity to do work.
; energy is conserved across all conversions: mechanical, thermal, electrical, chemical.
; the conservation law is the deepest niyama of physics.
; units: energy is kg⋅m²⋅s⁻² (joule)
; sangati roots

(kosha energy-varga
  (vishesa physics-varga)
  (swarupa subanta shakti)
  (matra joule kilogram metre second)
  (yukta niyama spanda kaala))
